#   maps.csv, maps_labeled*.csv          -> scraped business contacts (phone/email/address)
#   ranked_prospects*.csv                -> scored prospect lists + contact details
#   top_by_governorate*.csv              -> same, segmented
#   top_by_search_category*.csv          -> same, segmented
#   match_review*.csv                    -> customer names matched to map entities
#   features*.csv                        -> per-business features incl. geo coordinates

# Aggregate metrics only (no names, no contacts) — safe to track.
